        "title": "From death rattle to preventative repair - caught just in time.",
        "description": "The owner mentioned the noise to a mechanically minded friend, who immediately recognised it as the \"death rattle\" - the sound of a failing timing chain tensioner. The friend advised towing the vehicle to a specialist rather than driving.",
