            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "\"The tensioner hasn't failed yet, but it's on borrowed time. The chain has stretched, and the tensioner is nearly at its maximum extension. If you keep driving, the chain will eventually jump time. When that happens, the pistons hit the valves. That's a £5,000 engine replacement. We can replace the chain, guides, and updated tensioner now for £1,800.\""
